# The portal's own build context (M23.1). The repository-root .dockerignore does not apply
# here — this image is built with `context: ./developer-portal`, so without this file the
# whole of node_modules (hundreds of megabytes) is sent to the daemon before the first COPY.
#
# The deps stage installs from package.json + package-lock.json, and the build stage compiles
# from source, so neither needs anything excluded below.
node_modules/
.next/
out/
build/
.git/
.env*.local
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
Dockerfile
README.md
